{"slug":"Universal-Script-Json-Loader-193653","_id":"69d51c1b3dcab9078431ba9e","title":"Json Loader V1","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"This turns a JSON into a list, to make more easy to make scripts that use json.\n\n-NOTES-\nIm still making this script, maybe have bugs.\n\nIt's Open Source, see the \"HOW TO USE\".\n\nHOW TO USE:\n\n-Commands-\n\nJsonLoader.Load(URL needs to be .JSON)\n\n\nCODE example:\n\n--FIRST YOU NEED THIS.\nlocal JsonLoader = loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://zx-auth.onrender.com/files/APIs/jsonloader.lua\"))()\n\n--Second is this, to get a JSON from a site\nlocal list = JsonLoader.Load(\"https://test-site/temp.json\")\n\n--And this\nfor i,v in ipairs(list) do\n    print(i, v)\nend\n\n-TO DO-\n1. make a better version\n2. Make more easier to use","tags":[],"script":"--Maybe the server is down for some changes, also it's open source to YOU CHANGE.\nlocal JsonLoader = loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://zx-auth.onrender.com/files/APIs/jsonloader.lua\"))()\n\nlocal list = JsonLoader.Load(\"https://test-site/temp.json\")\n\nfor i,v in ipairs(list) do\n    print(i, v)\nend","owner":{"_id":"6861f639c4d70f2462a2bb08","username":"zxrealm","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/176a10ba2af2a22478562874ee69bdc9b7e55de5bc46c7903eb65c86c8f9d34f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6861f639c4d70f2462a2bb08-1757289556360.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6861f639c4d70f2462a2bb08","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/176a10ba2af2a22478562874ee69bdc9b7e55de5bc46c7903eb65c86c8f9d34f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6861f639c4d70f2462a2bb08-1757289556360.png"}},"verified":false,"views":727,"scriptType":"free